.TH TUX-BURNER 1 "October 2026" "Tux Burner 0.99" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tux-burner, tburn \- graphical GPU undervolting and tuning tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tux-burner
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts the Tux Burner window: AMD Tuning (on amdgpu), Auto-UV, Profiles, Game Library and
In-Game Overlay. The window changes nothing on the GPU until you press Apply, Run or similar and
confirm. See the user guide in /usr/share/doc/tux-burner/ and
.BR tburn-cli (1)
for the command line.
.PP
